  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate occult; <strong>CL</strong> 9th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> —; <strong>Price</strong> 41,400 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis wooden staff possesses a plant-like bud that conceals an organic eye. When a charge from the staff is spent, the bud opens. The staff allows the use of the following spells:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bolster binding† (1 charge)</li>\n<li>Comprehend languages (1 charge)</li>\n<li>Daze (1 charge)</li>\n<li>Detect pact spirits† (1 charge)</li>\n<li>Bind spirit I† (2 charges)</li>\n<li>Dismiss pact spirit† (2 charges)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Construction</strong><br>\nRequirements Craft Staff, bolster binding†, bind spirit I†, comprehend languages, daze, detect pact spirits†, dismiss pact spirits†; Cost 20,700 gp.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pm-staves#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
